  "notes": "Windows 开 TUN 更稳。\n\n- Windows 服务模式下开启 TUN 时，不再因网卡还在创建就误报 E008 启动失败：等网卡真正就绪再判断（最多 30 秒），网卡确认创建失败时直接提示“TUN 网卡未创建”并给出修复入口；核心进程意外退出时立即报错，不再空等。\n- 切换连接模式、恢复默认设置等操作进行中关闭页面，不再出现崩溃或设置没生效；全应用同类问题一并修复。\n- 连接失败时的诊断上报更完整：每次连接失败都会记录一次失败步骤和错误码（不含地址、账号等信息），取消连接不记为失败。\n",
  "notesEn": "Steadier TUN start on Windows.\n\n- On Windows in service mode, turning on TUN no longer reports a false E008 start failure while the adapter is still being created. The app now waits for the adapter to be ready (up to 30 seconds); if creating it really fails, you see \"The TUN adapter was not created\" with a repair option, and if the core process exits unexpectedly you are told right away instead of waiting.\n- Closing a page while switching connection mode or restoring default settings no longer crashes the app or leaves the setting unapplied; the same issue is fixed across the app.\n- Connection failure diagnostics are more complete: each failed connection records the failing step and error code once (no addresses or account details), and cancelling a connection is not counted as a failure.\n",
